laya_snapdragon/common.py and laya_snapdragon/tokenizer.py (prompt construction, question
rendering, calibration, confidence and the torch-free tokenizer wrapper) are taken from laya-mlx,
which adapted them from Laya. The ONNX export, NPU graph rewrites, bucket routing and QNN runtime
code are new.

Model weights (convaiinnovations/laya, Apache-2.0) are downloaded from Hugging Face by
`python -m laya_snapdragon build`; they are not included in this repository.

ONNX Runtime and the Qualcomm QNN libraries are installed from the onnxruntime-qnn package
under their own licenses.
